*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[B.B.Bunny]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*2 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Cammy (Enemy)|Cammy]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
**2 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
**2 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**2 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
